#: 72df12a125574f29b64131089f79978c
msgid "Configuring the echosounder module"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:20
#: 0445ee85cac4419a93cb568fed8cafff
msgid "The module should be configured before it is connected to the ArduPilot. You need the KOGGER Sonar module connected to computer. The GUI is opensource `Kogger Application <https://github.com/koggertech/KoggerApp/>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:24
#: d5263f2ccf4a462695990684f09f9592
msgid "Make the following adjustment in the GUI:"
